            { "rank": 8, "team": 10, "grade": "B", "text": "Their first seven scores averaged 130.62. The eighth looked like someone else had logged into the account." },
            { "rank": 9, "team": 9, "grade": "C", "text": "Sixth in scoring but ninth in the standings. Four straight head-to-head losses to open the season did plenty of damage before the offense settled in." },
